han one way. Keep a base you love, change a compatible charm or move it to another clasp-equipped SUIJI base. The structure connects the pieces; your choices make the combination personal.</p><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/the-mechanism' | replace: '//', '/' }}">See how it comes together<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></div></section><section class="r-section " id="sets"><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>Your first set</h2></div><p>Find your first set. See the looks, then see what is included.</p><div class="r-grid r-grid--sets"><article class="r-card" data-piece-card data-key="set01-stud-earring-set" data-category="sets" data-role="set"><a class="r-card__image" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/collections/sets?view=suiji-p-set01-stud-earring-set' | replace: '//', '/' }}"><img src="{{ 'suiji-home-modular-optimized.webp' | asset_url }}" width="1605" height="980" alt="Stud Earring Set" loading="eager" decoding="async"><span class="r-card__view">Explore ↗</span></a><div class="r-card__meta"><p class="r-eyebrow">Set</p><h3><a href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/collections/sets?view=suiji-p-set01-stud-earring-set' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Stud Earring Set</a></h3><p>One set</p><p class="r-price">Price to be confirmed</p></div></article><article class="r-card" data-piece-card data-key="set02-choker-set" data-category="sets" data-role="set"><a class="r-card__image" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/collections/sets?view=suiji-p-set02-choker-set' | replace: '//', '/' }}"><img src="{{ 'suiji-home-modular-optimized.webp' | asset_url }}" width="1605" height="980" alt="Choker Set" loading="eager" decoding="async"><span class="r-card__view">Explore ↗</span></a><div class="r-card__meta"><p class="r-eyebrow">Set</p><h3><a href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/collections/sets?view=suiji-p-set02-choker-set' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Choker Set</a></h3><p>One set</p><p class="r-price">Price to be confirmed</p></div></article><article clas