ch</h2></div><p>Occasional notes on new pieces, craft and more ways to wear what you love.</p><div data-native-newsletter>{% form 'customer', id: 'R107Newsletter', class: 'r-newsletter-form' %}<input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter"><label>Your email<input type="email" name="contact[email]" autocomplete="email" required></label><button class="r-button" type="submit">Subscribe</button><label class="r-newsletter-consent"><input type="checkbox" name="contact[accepts_marketing]" value="true" required><span>I would like to receive SUIJI news by email. I can unsubscribe at any time.</span></label>{% if form.posted_successfully? %}<p role="status">Thank you for subscribing. Check your inbox for any confirmation email.</p>{% elsif form.errors %}<div role="alert">{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</div>{% endif %}{% endform %}<a class="r-caption" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/policies/privacy-policy' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Privacy & choices</a></div></section></div>
